# Shared calc.fdf template for all 3 cluster_n{0,1,2} relaxations.
# stb-gqca's own force_full_relaxation() rewrites MD.TypeOfRun to CG and
# adds MD.VariableCell T unconditionally for a 3D input (see the README's
# Section 2) -- this template's own MD block is a plausible starting
# point only, not what actually ends up in the written calc.fdf files.
SystemLabel siesta
%include structure.fdf

PAO.BasisType split
PAO.BasisSize DZP
Mesh.CutOff 200 Ry
XC.functional GGA
XC.authors PBE
Spin non-polarized

MD.MaxForceTol 0.02 eV/Ang
MD.Steps 150
